{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-219661","model_call":39,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ dbcp edb \"methyl bromide\" aldicarb fenamiphos) (+ nematicide nematicides fumigant) (+ banned withdrawn phased-out discontinued) (+ health environmental ozone groundwater))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ dbcp edb \"methyl bromide\" aldicarb fenamiphos) (+ nematicide nematicides fumigant) (+ banned withdrawn phased-out discontinued) (+ health environmental ozone groundwater))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_1062712741#2_1295395898","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1502","rank":1,"snippet":": 2892.000000 , \"headings\": \"1,2-Dibromo-3-chloropropane 1,2-Dibromo-3-chloropropane From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Contents Stereoisomerism Uses Sources and potential exposure Examples of persistence Lawsuits Safety References External links \" , \"segment\": \"Infobox references Chemical compound 1,2-Dibromo-3-chloropropane, ( dibromochloropropane) better known as <cover>DBCP, is the organic compound with the formula BrCH (CH 2 Br) (CH 2 Cl). It is a dense colorless liquid although commercial samples often appear amber or even brown. It is the active ingredient in the nematicide Nemagon, also known as Fumazone. It is a soil fumigant formerly used in American agriculture. In mammals it causes male sterility at high levels of exposure. After discovery of its deleterious health effects on humans, the compound was banned </cover>from use in 1979 by the United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA). The continuing presence of the chemical as a contaminant in ground water remains a problem for many communities for years after end of use. Contents 1 Stereoisomerism 2 Uses 3 Sources and potential exposure 4 Examples of persistence 5 Lawsuits 6 Safety 7 References 8 External links Stereoisomerism 1,2-","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_1062712741#2_1295395898","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":115},"model_calls":39,"document_judgments":22,"relevance_3":11,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
