{"actor":"model","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-219661","model_call":82,"attempt":1,"model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input_tokens":37667,"output_tokens":206,"total_tokens":37873,"cached_tokens":35584,"reasoning_tokens":17},"output_characters":842,"decision":{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_08_1179094178#13_2116809753","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage directly supports the information need by stating that, because of health risks and environmental concerns, there are currently no toxic nematicides labeled for established home lawns; it also contrasts safer organic/biological products, showing safety-driven loss of conventional nematicide options.","learned":"Health risks and environmental concerns can eliminate labeled uses of toxic nematicides in certain settings, leaving only safer but often less-proven organic/biological products."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1536","reason":"The current query is yielding new direct evidence on toxicity, health risks, environmental concerns, and lost/absent nematicide labels; continue to find additional non-duplicate documents."}}}
